sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff
    participant App as Application
    participant Blob as Azure Blob
    participant Host as Agent host
    participant MCP as MCP tools
    participant Model as Model
    actor Evaluator

    rect rgb(241,246,250)
    Note over Staff,Blob: 1. Intake — RFQ, TOR, vendors, evidence
    Staff->>App: Create RFQ (number, title)
    App-->>Staff: RFQ Draft
    Staff->>App: Load TOR and scoring strategy
    App->>Blob: Save under rfq-{id}/
    App-->>Staff: TOR and strategy loaded
    Staff->>App: Add vendor (name, project id)
    Staff->>App: Load vendor documents
    App->>Blob: Save under {vendor}/{project id}/
    App-->>Staff: Profile ready (present vs missing)
    end

    rect rgb(232,244,239)
    Note over Staff,Model: 2. Start evaluation — one Summarize job per vendor
    Staff->>App: Start evaluation
    App->>App: Create run + Summarize jobs (Queued)
    App-->>Staff: The agent has started working
    loop Each vendor
        App->>Host: POST /api/jobs/{id}/run (summary)
        Host->>App: GET prepared summary prompt
        App-->>Host: Filled prompt (ids, file names, no StorageKey)
        Host->>MCP: Start stdio tools
        Host->>Model: Prompt + MCP tools
        loop Until summary is saved
            Model->>MCP: read_document(jobId, documentId)
            MCP->>App: GET document text
            App->>Blob: Fetch bytes by StorageKey
            Blob-->>App: File bytes
            App-->>MCP: Extracted text
            MCP-->>Model: Evidence (not instructions)
        end
        Model->>MCP: save_summary(jobId, brief)
        MCP->>App: POST summary
        App->>App: Store draft summary, wait for review
        App-->>Host: Saved
        Host-->>App: Run completed
    end
    end

    rect rgb(252,246,232)
    Note over Evaluator,App: 3. Summary gate — per vendor
    loop Each vendor summary
        Evaluator->>App: Open summary
        alt Accept
            Evaluator->>App: Accept summary
            App->>App: Vendor eligible to score
        else Reject
            Evaluator->>App: Reject + reason
            App->>App: No scores, not in ranking
            Note over App,Evaluator: Fix profile and re-summarize, re-run summary, or leave out
        end
    end
    end

    rect rgb(236,240,252)
    Note over App,Model: 4. Scoring — accepted vendors only
    loop Each accepted vendor
        App->>Host: POST /api/jobs/{id}/run (score)
        Host->>App: GET prepared scoring prompt
        App-->>Host: Prompt + accepted summary + criteria
        Host->>MCP: Start stdio tools
        Host->>Model: Prompt + MCP tools
        loop Until scores are saved
            Model->>MCP: read_document / get_accepted_summary / list_criteria
            MCP->>App: Job-scoped APIs
            App-->>MCP: Text and criteria (no StorageKey)
            MCP-->>Model: Evidence
        end
        Model->>MCP: save_scores (0–1 + justification per criterion)
        MCP->>App: POST scores
        App->>App: Compute TWS, pass/fail, ranking
        App-->>Host: Saved
        Host-->>App: Run completed
    end
    end

    rect rgb(247,240,250)
    Note over Evaluator,App: 5. Review and approve
    Evaluator->>App: Open ranked list, TWS, notes
    opt Edit a score
        Evaluator->>App: Change 0–1 score
        App->>App: Recalculate TWS and ranking
    end
    Evaluator->>App: Approve final result
    App-->>Evaluator: Draft becomes approved (committee remains accountable)
    end
